<title>USA: Hallwood sets three-for-one stock split.</title>
<headline>Hallwood sets three-for-one stock split.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hallwood Consolidated Resources Corp said  on Friday it declared a three-for-one stock split and increased its  authorized number of common shares to 10 million from two million.</p>
<p>The stock dividend payment date is August 11 for shareholders of record  as of August 4, the company said in a news release.</p>
<p>After the split, Hallwood will have 2,977,542 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Hallwood is an oil and natural gas company.</p>
